Your abilities in sowing confusion and chaos have reached their peak.  Whenever a foe attempts to apply a detrimental physical effect to you, they have a [11%, 20%, 25%, 29%, 31% (TL1-5)] chance to fail. If there is an adjacent enemy to you, you misdirect your foe into applying it to them at [26%, 35%, 41%, 46%, 50% (TL1-5)] duration.

You gain [22, 29, 34, 38, 42 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] defense.

The chance to apply status effects increases with your Accuracy and the Defense with your Cunning.
